Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:05.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Level 6？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 是Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你將要成為學園都市的夢想哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.71,0:00:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爺爺 我就要成為這城市的夢想...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 是成為這個夢想的基石
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yellow Marble 報告 Marble Leader
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.15,0:00:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經到達現場
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始搬運
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Brown Marble 你那邊怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色跑車是不是追著你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.99,0:00:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和預料中一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.55,0:00:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬧劇結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多該進入最終章了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等著吧 我一定會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:23.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知道有什麼好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精心策劃的惡作劇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們想搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.86,0:01:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你們會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木山博士 這輛車是誘餌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子們不在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:46.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好窄 喂 初春你好重
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.18,0:01:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請上車
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來導航
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.21,0:01:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快啊 不是要救孩子們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你們的對手是...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到這裡可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這可疑的能力是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:35.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我說句「主角登場」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來這裡就是我的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空力操縱大展身手的舞台了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:41.99,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(292,438)}<Aero Hand>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.35,0:02:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就交給我們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人請去助木山春生一臂之力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是待會沒有追過來 我不會原諒你的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明知我是姐姐大人的最佳拍擋白井黑子 還想造次嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 請你不要搶別人的招牌台詞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.41,0:03:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 我們上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然會和你搭檔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連做夢都沒想過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁這機會 來比比到底誰的能力更強吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的部隊出發不久後
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有兩台貨車偽裝成民用車輛從MAR總部出發
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個記錄...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被警備員的監視衛星監測到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.53,0:05:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊才是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說我輕易地被誘餌騙到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:46.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們好像已經到目的地了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地點在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十三學區
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.13,0:05:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒在用的推進系統研究所
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面的岔路走左邊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.79,0:06:02.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 不這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就沒有宰掉你們的價值了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,固法學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.87,0:06:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才那是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 不拚了命逃跑的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會變成肉醬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那聲音是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個女人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到 到底在幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再開快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用你說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我...錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,換個立場 我也會做同樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次的失敗 我會在這裡補回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電擊被彈開了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為那種玩意會有效嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 就用這招
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:37.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的超電磁砲 射程只有50m
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.26,0:07:48.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的所有能力在資料庫裡都寫得清清楚楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙太可惡了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面的岔路也走左邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:07:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有通訊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 沒打中嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Green Marble 到你們那邊了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹掉她們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是 Green Marble
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在遭到警備員的襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們休想再往前一步
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 我們已經牽制了路上的部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 因為上級施壓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這樣已經很勉強了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼警備員會...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少廢話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快去救孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 一群沒用的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓穩了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 真會閃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也該死心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論你們怎麼掙扎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都救不了那群小鬼的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是這樣 我也發誓要一直掙扎下去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師怎麼能放棄自己的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.81,0:09:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何 我都要護送你到那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是為此才來到這裡的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今 你還能作什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 這又怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的攻擊手段 我全都知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就讓你見識一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑子！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能射的 不只是硬幣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這 是我的全力 一擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:43.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 突然間就空間轉移
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐 白井
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:56.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:10:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了 謝謝...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你救到孩子們之後再說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 能查得到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.06,0:11:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系統的防禦太嚴密了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪姐姐大人把他們全都解決掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才不知道裡面完全沒人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:39.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在在這個設施裡頭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一個地方的用電量超高
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是最下層區域的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上 春上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 這裡的系統...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等一下 我去看看那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 現在就來救你們...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你們沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這聲音...難道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這群臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 你...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是剛才的回禮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白井 御坂學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:42.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:46.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才那是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真爽 剛才竟然敢小看我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:58.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是Capacity Down吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是御坂學姐說的 只會讓能力者痛苦的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這聲音？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 就算知道了你又打算怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得 改良版很大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,固定後的擴音器 不能移動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 但是設置在整座設施裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你要一個個拆掉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼大一個系統 能夠控制的地方很有限
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:34.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我調查過這建築物裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能控制的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我們剛才還在的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中央管制室！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初春
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 你去試試啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前提是你做得到才行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 有夠囉嗦的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.43,0:13:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得我還想給你們看個好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「能力體結晶之完成」啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:05.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:09.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己 不是也是犧牲者嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當了爺爺的白老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,導致能力失控
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是犧牲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是得到了權利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我生出的這顆種子開花
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道那...就是First Sample
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得到孕育出Level 6的權利啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.89,0:14:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Level...6
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:43.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 這傢伙將成為學園都市首個Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用這群小鬼的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你 要將春上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位於特定波長下 能發揮出超過自身等級的收訊能力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙的能力跟能力體結晶產生共振 實在再適合不過了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟高等級的精神感應者是很稀有的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼又是這群孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼總是讓他們受苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼 只不過想借用一下他們腦子裡的「現實」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只屬於自己的現實
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:30.06,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(424,436)}<Personal Reality>
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 什麼名稱都無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是他們掌管腦內活動的神經傳導物質
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是提取沉睡中失控能力者的這些物質
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再跟First Sample融合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣能力體結晶就會獲得抑制失控的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.42,0:15:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成為完美的成品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那個老頭沒注意到這一點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只會一味地對這東西進行小修改
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 接下來就是將這東西...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這樣做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果孩子們是在失控狀態下醒來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學園都市就會發生空前的亂雜開放 然後毀滅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.59,0:16:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以非神之身 到達天上意志者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學園都市就是為此而存在的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Level 6誕生了 這個都市不就完成任務了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別浪費我的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木山老...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖待在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:50.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天 佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪個 是哪個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個什麼什麼Down 到底是哪個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾經說過一件有趣的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這聲音是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「武裝無能力集團不是白老鼠」～？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 不只他們是白老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們所有人都是白老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學園都市是實驗動物的飼養場
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這群小鬼個個都是家畜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:25.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多該讓你解脫了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.43,0:17:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是白老鼠還是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.89,0:17:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些事 我才不管那麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有一個小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼她還能動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准對我朋友下手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聲音停了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你們跟這個設施一起轟爆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙是分析過你的能力後製造的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比你的超電磁砲還要強力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 又白老鼠又家畜的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.09,0:18:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是多麼可憐自己才會懷恨到這種程度
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電擊使 Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:29.19,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(374,438)}<Electro Master>
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個都市 你只是一份資料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 只會講大話的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學園都市是個能讓我們活出真正自我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最棒的歸宿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是我一個人做不到的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和大家一起的話 就能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.55,0:18:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不是人類 只是樣本
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是學園都市
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的 只屬於我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你救了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就大功告成了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,軟體完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.93,0:20:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絆理說 她相信老師
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼變成熊貓眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:09.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我...太忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的哦 頭髮也長了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.49,0:21:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 的確是老師啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.02,0:21:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是木山老師啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衿衣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:37.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 願意聆聽我的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.37,0:21:50.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次讓我好好說一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎麼說好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孤軍奮戰 勇猛奮鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:16.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白井嚇跑了以後 就我一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.55,0:22:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面對潮水般湧來的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一手丟一個 順手又丟一個 就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.08,0:22:25.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 傳聞中阻止了大規模亂雜開放的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.02,0:22:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是婚后學姐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.06,0:22:29.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能快點來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衿衣 初春她們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說很快就能追上來 叫我們先走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.60,0:22:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過話說回來還真慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得到了紀念日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.13,0:22:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再不快一點就趕不上了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.79,0:22:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,御坂學姐和白井竟然會遲到 真難得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.48,0:22:58.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 姐姐大人偏偏今天睡過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.04,0:23:02.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了 你自己不是也睡死了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過真意外啊 御坂學姐居然會想出這個點子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.95,0:23:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.61,0:23:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是超有御坂學姐風格的浪漫點子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.13,0:23:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:20.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白井？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.89,0:23:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 還沒到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.72,0:23:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 也不是什麼大事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人醒過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.06,0:23:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然開始錄口供了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.95,0:23:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她大概不會輕易開口呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 嗯 謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.85,0:23:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.81,0:23:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來要把所有事情都搞清楚 還要一點時間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.85,0:23:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 現在不是做這個的時候 要趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.35,0:23:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.57,0:23:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.25,0:23:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.05,0:23:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.02,0:24:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備～
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.64,0:24:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木山老師～
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.37,0:24:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快樂～
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要快點康復哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.09,0:24:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也會加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在等你哦 老師
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.69,0:24:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 木山老師
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.40,0:24:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.54,0:25:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不會讓人覺得無聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.93,0:25:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個都市
