Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:26.33,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}解き放つ今全てを
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:26.33,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}此刻解放所有一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:27.58,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Just truth in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:30.43,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}いつだって迷わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:30.43,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}無論何時都不應迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:33.19,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}消せない想いがあるから
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:33.19,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}因為有著無法磨滅的思念
