Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:37.32,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}直視那已經揭開的真相
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:40.64,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}I'll reach the next stage to realize all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.49,0:08:49.09,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}遠く感じてた　君が走る背中を
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.49,0:08:49.09,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}曾經感覺如此遙遠的 你奔跑著的背影
