Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:02.67,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}但是我不會再回望過去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:03.72,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Just truth in my heart
