Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.40,0:18:40.64,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}誰かをきっと守れるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.40,0:18:40.64,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}將重要的人守護
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:43.90,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Looking！The blitz loop this planet to search way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:43.90,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}看吧 在這閃電充斥的星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:47.67,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Only my RAILGUN can shoot it.今すぐ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:47.67,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}如今只有我的電磁炮能脫穎而出
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:54.37,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}身体中を　光の速さで　駆け巡った　確かな予感
