Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.13,0:19:04.05,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}限界など知らない　意味無い！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.13,0:19:04.05,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}極限什麼的不去管它 因為毫無意義
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:13.12,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}この能力が光り散らす　その先に遥かな想いを
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:13.12,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)\pos(48,0)\fs8}チカラ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:13.12,ocn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}以此之力綻放遙遠彼方的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:04.87,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Dear My Freind  Every day & night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:08.01,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Always be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.03,0:22:11.96,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Dear My Freind  Every day & night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.60,0:22:15.43,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Always be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:23.25,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}話しても　まだまだ　足りないまま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:23.25,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}話還遠遠沒有說夠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:30.64,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}夕焼けが　街を染めてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:30.64,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}晚霞已染紅了街道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.16,0:22:38.07,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}思うように　なかなか　いかない…って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.16,0:22:38.07,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}世事難都如人願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:45.73,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}気づいたら　一緒に　泣いていた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:45.73,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}察覺時已相依哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:49.78,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}恋も　夢も　花も　虹も　風も
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:49.78,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}戀情 夢想 鮮花 彩虹 微風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:52.32,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}ぜんぶ掴もうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:52.32,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}抓緊這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.44,0:22:56.08,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}ダイジョウブ！  元気出して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.44,0:22:56.08,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}沒事的  打起精神來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:23:00.43,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}私がそばにいるから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:23:00.43,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}因為有我在你的身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.55,0:23:07.22,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}今日のミス　悔むより　今　乗り越えて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.55,0:23:07.22,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}與其悔恨今日不如放眼明天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:10.94,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}ダイジョウブ！  迷わないで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:10.94,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}沒事的  不要迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.98,0:23:17.02,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}まだ見ぬ未来へと向かって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.98,0:23:17.02,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}向著未知的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:22.07,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}ずっと　歩いてゆこう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:22.07,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}永遠走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.67,0:23:24.81,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9\be1\fad(50,50)}Dear My Freind  Every day & night
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.16,0:23:27.97,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)\an9}Always be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:31.96,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Dear My Freind  Every day & night
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.71,0:23:35.85,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}Always be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.44,0:23:43.29,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}私だって　いろいろ　悩むけど
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.44,0:23:43.29,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}我也有著許多煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:50.68,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}考えても　答えは出ないまま…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:50.68,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}無論如何思索也難理清頭緒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.20,0:23:58.11,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}見上げれば　きらきら　一番星
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.20,0:23:58.11,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}仰望天空 看那閃閃發光的啟明星
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:24:05.77,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}きれいだね　ふと笑顔こぼれた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:24:05.77,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}感歎著它的美麗 頓時綻放笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:09.82,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}愛も　傷も　過去も　今も　明日も
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:09.82,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}愛情 傷痛 過去 現在 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:12.36,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}すべて受け止めよう
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:12.36,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}承受這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:16.12,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}ダイジョウブ！  勇気だすよ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:16.12,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}沒事的  鼓起勇氣來
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:20.47,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}私はひとりじゃないから
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:20.47,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}因為有我在你的身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.59,0:24:27.26,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}諦めず　躊躇わず　一歩　踏み出して
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.59,0:24:27.26,ecn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(50,50)}不要放棄 別再躊躇 邁出那最初的一步
